### Updated ZIP APIs. Base URL and paths are identical in Postman.
### Replace placeholders and use one cookie jar. No Bearer token is used.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@csrf = COPY_X_CSRF_TOKEN_FROM_A_PROTECTED_GET_RESPONSE
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@accountId = REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID_NOT_ACCOUNT_NUMBER

### Email login remains available. Use your existing password.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"your.registered.email@example.com","password":"YOUR_EXISTING_PASSWORD"}

### Alternative mobile/password login: send phone OR email, never both.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"9876543210","password":"YOUR_EXISTING_PASSWORD"}

### CUSTOMER session: all owned accounts; response header supplies X-CSRF-TOKEN.
GET {{base}}/api/accounts

### ADMIN session: get users and copy its X-CSRF-TOKEN response header.
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users

### ADMIN only: user details.
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}

### ADMIN only: returns every account owned by this user.
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/accounts

### ADMIN only: creates another administrator, with no customer account.
### The initial password has no automatic expiry or forced-change behavior.
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"New administrator","email":"new.admin@example.com","phone":"9876543210","initialPassword":"CHOOSE_A_NEW_STRONG_PASSWORD"}

### ADMIN only: status changes are audited. Inactive sessions lose access.
### Statuses: ACTIVE, LOCKED, SUSPENDED, INACTIVE; invalid transitions return 409.
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"status":"SUSPENDED"}

### ADMIN only: explicit simulated credit (changes the simulated ledger).
### Choose a fresh unique key for a NEW credit; retain the same key/body/account
### for all retries of THIS credit. A lost response is not permission for a new key.
POST {{base}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/interest-credits
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_A_UNIQUE_KEY_FOR_THIS_CREDIT

{"amount":"1000.03"}

### Existing transaction APIs now also return protectionRemainingMillis and canCancel.
### Server state and database deadlines remain authoritative.
GET {{base}}/api/transactions
